@startuml FRQ-PRC-16.3-class
' Klasni model procesora prihvata i onoga što predaje platnu.
' Gledište: struktura (izvedba). Publika: implementator, tester.
' Prikaz, ne izvor istine (D-13) — izvor su FRQ-PRC-16.3 §1, §5, temeljni sloj
' concrete/processor.py, IBlackboard i kod blackwattle processors/sdr.py (usklađeno 2026-09-11).
' Procesor po smjeru ne postoji i plan ugađanja nije njegov — oboje je u sloju konekcije
' (autor, 2026-09-11). Razred dokumenta bira strategija stvaranja; FRQ-DOC-16.4 nije napisan.
title FRQ-PRC-16.3 — SDRReadProcessor class model

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "concrete · existing" #F4F4F4 {
  abstract class GenericProcessor {
    +blackboard : IBlackboard
    +cycle : int
    +flush_per_cycle : bool
    +write_context : dict
    +start() : None
    +register_pipeline(pipeline: IPipeline) : None
    +register_blackboard(blackboard: IBlackboard) : None
    +save_state() : GenericMemento
    +restore_state(memento: GenericMemento) : None
    {abstract} +create_generator() : Generator[ITarget]
  }
  interface IBlackboard {
    +create(caller: IProcessor, **kwargs) : ITarget
    +flush(caller: IWattleflow, **kwargs) : None
  }
}

class DriverSDR <<see FRQ-DRV-16.2-class>>
class SDRSampleBlock <<see FRQ-DRV-16.2-class>>

class SDRReadProcessor {
  {static} +ALLOWED : list[str]
  {static} +SEGMENT_BLOCKS : int = 1
  +summary : SDRPassSummary
  +create_generator() : Generator[ITarget]
}

class SDRPassSummary <<value>> {
  +blocks : int
  +samples : int
  +documents : int
  +duration : float
  +lost : int | None
  +effective : dict | None
  +partial : bool
  +reason : str | None
  +as_record() : dict
}

class "create strategy\n(FRQ-DOC-16.4, unwritten)" as CS <<open>>

GenericProcessor <|-- SDRReadProcessor
SDRReadProcessor --> DriverSDR : driver (injected by the factory)
SDRReadProcessor ..> SDRSampleBlock : consumes
SDRReadProcessor *-- SDRPassSummary
SDRReadProcessor ..> IBlackboard : create(caller, content, metadata)
IBlackboard ..> CS : strategy_create

note right of SDRReadProcessor
  <b>ALLOWED</b>: driver, stop_blocks, stop_seconds,
  segment_blocks — a boundary is mandatory (BR-08)
  ----
  One document = up to segment_blocks blocks,
  never across two frequencies.
  <b>content</b>: the segment's samples, concatenated.
  <b>metadata</b>: the first block's description +
  sample_count, blocks, loss_measured.
  ----
  One summary record per pass: INFO when whole,
  WARNING when partial (NFRQ-OBS-03).
end note

note bottom of GenericProcessor
  start() is the base loop: it drives the generator,
  runs every pipeline over each item, flushes and
  writes one INFO record per document.
  A pipeline failure ends the pass — the rule
  (author, 2026-09-11); exemptions are open.
  save_state / restore_state: a live stream has no
  rewindable position (FRQ-PRC-16.3 §11 t.1).
end note
@enduml
